806fa2f79d.webp?t=1741374973\" width=600 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919690/extras/e9e2515bd6ed7a9b65fa69fbabf8ab2f.poster.avif?t=1741374973\" width=746 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919690/extras/e9e2515bd6ed7a9b65fa69fbabf8ab2f.webm?t=1741374973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919690/extras/e9e2515bd6ed7a9b65fa69fbabf8ab2f.mp4?t=1741374973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Interaction:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your Divine Hand to interact directly with the world. Shape the terrain, move objects, and manipulate the fate of mortals. Draw runes on the ground to cast miracles that alter the course of events: unleash beneficial rains, grow forests, or provoke devastating calamities. Each miracle requires Power, obtained through the faith of your followers and the mysterious energies of the island. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919690/extras/51afd5a1a5da99dfe3e54e6b4500eb54.webp?t=1741374973\" width=600 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919690/extras/b440ded92777a68eef4a03dc6046059a.poster.avif?t=1741374973\" width=606 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919690/extras/b440ded92777a68eef4a03dc6046059a.webm?t=1741374973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919690/extras/b440ded92777a68eef4a03dc6046059a.mp4?t=1741374973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mysteries of the Island:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island you rule is rich in secrets and wonders. At its center stands a sapling of Yggdrasil, the cosmic tree, which you can protect or exploit to gain additional Power. Explore ancient caves, discover hidden runes, and interact with entities like Hel and the Norns. Use the Thread of the Norns to anticipate your opponents' moves and plan your actions. Each discovery adds depth to your adventure, offering unique challenges and rewards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Competition Among Deities:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not the only one seeking glory. Other deities compete for the mortals' faith. Defend your island from enemy attacks, sabotage their plans, and employ strategies to convert their followers to your cause. Every citizen can change their faith based on divine actions that influence their life, making the competition intense and strategic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919690/extras/a080aa6635652d91063f24221adc44da.poster.avif?t=1741374973\" width=600 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919690/extras/a080aa6635652d91063f24221adc44da.webm?t=1741374973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919690/extras/a080aa6635652d91063f24221adc44da.mp4?t=1741374973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919690/extras/3ef13adc6d57a2ea9d6bbe806fa2f79d.webp?t=1741374973\" width=600 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919690/extras/05454773dc8a7afde0716719bbef48e3.poster.avif?t=1741374973\" width=600 height=152 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919690/extras/05454773dc8a7afde0716719bbef48e3.webm?t=1741374973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919690/extras/05454773dc8a7afde0716719bbef48e3.mp4?t=1741374973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Building and Management:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your capital and develop a prosperous society. Assign roles to citizens\u2014such as farmers, woodcutters, priests, and explorers\u2014to grow and sustain your civilization. Manage vital resources like food, wood, and stone, carefully planning to meet the population's needs. Every economic and social decision impacts the well-being of your followers and their faith in you, directly influencing your divine ascent. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919690/extras/51afd5a1a5da99dfe3e54e6b4500eb54.webp?t=1741374973\" width=600 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919690/extras/20460a332a7fcc34b580b05ae11dc4f7.poster.avif?t=1741374973\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919690/extras/20460a332a7fcc34b580b05ae11dc4f7.webm?t=1741374973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919690/extras/20460a332a7fcc34b580b05ae11dc4f7.mp4?t=1741374973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Living and Mythological World:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the passing of seasons and years, with day and night cycles that affect the citizens' activities. Interact with deities like Freya, Loki, and Odin, each with their own personality and agenda. Explore the depths of Norse mythology, unveiling secrets and intertwining your destiny with that of the gods. Your actions write the history of mortals and shape the fate of the world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reach Asgard and claim your place among the major deities. The fate of mankind is in your hands: will you be a loved or feared god?</strong></p>",
